@# Basic authored hubs for hidden and suspicious places.

@entry place.hub.smugglers-den
  @scene place.smugglers-den
  @place-key smugglers_den
  @hub place
@endentry

:: place.smugglers-den [place hub]
@kind place
@heading "Smuggler's Den"
@choices "Activities"

People lower their voices inside {{place.name}}.

@choice room "Look around carefully" -> place.smugglers-den
  @icon 👀
@endchoice

@choice contact "Approach someone who looks informed" -> place.smugglers-den
  @icon 🕵️
@endchoice

@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

